test('enemy route validation can be replayed without bombs on desktop and mobile',()=>{for(const height of [270,384])for(const level of [35,150]){const g=game(()=>.5);g.api.start();const speed=102*(1+level*.01),gap=90,b=g.scene.inspect().bird;g.scene.setup({height,level,passed:35,scrollSpeed:speed,bird:{x:b.x,y:height*.43,v:-145},pipes:[{x:350,y:height*.45-gap/2,gap,passed:true}],spawn:100,bombSpawn:100,enemySpawn:100});const bird=g.scene.inspect().bird,e=g.scene.createEnemy();assert.ok(e);const horizon=e.warning+(e.x-bird.x)/e.speed+.45;const path=g.routes.findRoute({previous:null,pipe:null,x:bird.x,y:null,height,speed,settings:g.scene.motionSettings(),startY:bird.y,startV:bird.v,birdX:bird.x,horizon,obstacles:g.scene.inspect().pipes,hazards:[{...e,targetSpeed:e.speed}]});assert.ok(path);g.scene.setup({enemies:[e]});for(let i=1;i<path.length;i++){if(path[i].flap)g.api.flap();g.scene.update(path[i].t-path[i-1].t);assert.equal(g.api.getState().state,'playing','enemy route '+height+'/'+level+'/'+i);}assert.equal(g.api.getState().bombs,0);assert.equal(g.api.getState().score,g.api.getState().bonus.rasantes);assert.equal(g.api.getState().pipesPassed,35);}});
